      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحَّةٌ</span></b>  [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيَّةٌ رَحَّةٌ</span>] <i>A serpent being,</i> or <i>becoming,
like a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوْق</span>, or <i>neck-ring,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَطَوِّقَةٌ</span>, K, [see 5 in
