<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحْيَةٌ</span>; (K;) the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span> being changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span>. (TA.)

